tel 1.0

# The topics an example may be about: the first of its two aspects, what a reader wants to do.
# Each is a tutorial in doc/soundness/modules, by whose file name it is known, so an example of
# the topic `json` is a file in doc/examples/json. doc/examples/readme.md explains the store.

